(7351619, 1149519, 19825, '<td valign="top">Interesting structure and clever title.</td>', 'Interesting structure and clever title.', '2015-05-19 19:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351628, 1149852, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image sneaks up on you, hidden in the tall grass.  I love how the building emerges in a flurried blend of yellow-green and faded red.  That''s the joy I find and am grateful for it.</td>', 'This image sneaks up on you, hidden in the tall grass.  I love how the building emerges in a flurried blend of yellow-green and faded red.  That''s the joy I find and am grateful for it.', '2015-05-19 19:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351631, 1149721, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like how the clouds in the background seem to be a cloud of dust raised by a cataclysm that undid this structure, but it''s the confounding presence of the black basketball that juices up this image.  It implies, to me, that the world is full of disjunctions, so don''t settle back into ennui or smugness, keep an open mind and enjoy the zigzags.  I also like the matter-of-fact dreaminess here.  So, bravo.</td>', 'I like how the clouds in the background seem to be a cloud of dust raised by a cataclysm that undid this structure, but it''s the confounding presence of the black basketball that juices up this image.  It implies, to me, that the world is full of disjunctions, so don''t settle back into ennui or smugness, keep an open mind and enjoy the zigzags.  I also like the matter-of-fact dreaminess here.  So, bravo.', '2015-05-19 20:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351641, 1149871, 173844, '<td valign="top">A mesmerizing tsunami of wood and metal.  I like the hint of action here, being coyly invited inside but then denied by the jutting roof.  The composition is busy but rewarding.  A dignified demise.  Nice.</td>', 'A mesmerizing tsunami of wood and metal.  I like the hint of action here, being coyly invited inside but then denied by the jutting roof.  The composition is busy but rewarding.  A dignified demise.  Nice.', '2015-05-19 20:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351701, 1149901, 30982, '<td valign="top">The hand is quite fascinating.</td>', 'The hand is quite fascinating.', '2015-05-20 00:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351702, 1149806, 30982, '<td valign="top">Makes one wonder what the story is here.</td>', 'Makes one wonder what the story is here.', '2015-05-20 00:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351703, 1149849, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome structure - nicely photographed.</td>', 'Awesome structure - nicely photographed.', '2015-05-20 00:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351704, 1149880, 30982, '<td valign="top">Eeerie.....</td>', 'Eeerie.....', '2015-05-20 00:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351705, 1149823, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kinda pretty, in a way.</td>', 'Kinda pretty, in a way.', '2015-05-20 00:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351706, 1149596, 30982, '<td valign="top">The two hour parking seems a bit pointless.</td>', 'The two hour parking seems a bit pointless.', '2015-05-20 00:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351707, 1149822, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the reflection.</td>', 'Very nice use of the reflection.', '2015-05-20 00:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351713, 1149743, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely has the creepy vibe going on here.</td>', 'Definitely has the creepy vibe going on here.', '2015-05-20 00:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351714, 1149878, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good subject, good light - might be better served by a less than straight-on presentation to add more interest.  The overall feel is just a touch "muddy" - not sure why - perhaps processing?</td>', 'A good subject, good light - might be better served by a less than straight-on presentation to add more interest.  The overall feel is just a touch "muddy" - not sure why - perhaps processing?', '2015-05-20 00:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351715, 1149661, 30982, '<td valign="top">The angle chosen and the mist both serve to add to the abandoned feel of this.  I almost want those wee bits of trash removed, though.</td>', 'The angle chosen and the mist both serve to add to the abandoned feel of this.  I almost want those wee bits of trash removed, though.', '2015-05-20 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351736, 1149822, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very cool with the reflection.</td>', 'Very cool with the reflection.', '2015-05-20 00:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351737, 1149787, 23484, '<td valign="top">Cool looking old truck.</td>', 'Cool looking old truck.', '2015-05-20 00:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351738, 1149823, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the composition.</td>', 'I love the composition.', '2015-05-20 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351740, 1149578, 23484, '<td valign="top">The processing is pretty neat.</td>', 'The processing is pretty neat.', '2015-05-20 00:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351742, 1149858, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the way it shows both sides. Like two different worlds.</td>', 'I like the way it shows both sides. Like two different worlds.', '2015-05-20 00:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351743, 1149661, 23484, '<td valign="top">The slight misty look is very nice.</td>', 'The slight misty look is very nice.', '2015-05-20 00:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351744, 1149849, 23484, '<td valign="top">This has such an ominous feel. I love it.</td>', 'This has such an ominous feel. I love it.', '2015-05-20 00:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351747, 1149806, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. An abandoned neighborhood. Makes you wonder what happened.  Excellent job on the processing. 10</td>', 'This is excellent. An abandoned neighborhood. Makes you wonder what happened.  Excellent job on the processing. 10', '2015-05-20 00:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351749, 1149519, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Reminds me of Ireland.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Reminds me of Ireland.', '2015-05-20 00:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351751, 1149817, 23484, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet it took some time to paint that.</td>', 'I''ll bet it took some time to paint that.', '2015-05-20 00:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351755, 1149901, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very creepy looking. Nice find.</td>', 'Very creepy looking. Nice find.', '2015-05-20 00:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351756, 1149646, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the grain.</td>', 'I love the grain.', '2015-05-20 00:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351757, 1149899, 23484, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective.</td>', 'I really like the perspective.', '2015-05-20 00:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351863, 1149661, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely mood in this one!</td>', 'Lovely mood in this one!', '2015-05-20 03:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351865, 1149822, 114285, '<td valign="top">Top score so far, wonderfully haunting!</td>', 'Top score so far, wonderfully haunting!', '2015-05-20 04:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351866, 1149519, 114285, '<td valign="top">Maybe a touch too much sky, but a wonderful image nevertheless, bump.</td>', 'Maybe a touch too much sky, but a wonderful image nevertheless, bump.', '2015-05-20 04:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351868, 1149849, 114285, '<td valign="top">PP is PERFECT for this challenge, and so is the photo, in my top two.</td>', 'PP is PERFECT for this challenge, and so is the photo, in my top two.', '2015-05-20 04:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351916, 1149838, 179852, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing composition-the bars on one side, angular lines on the other, and that surprising human figure!</td>', 'Very pleasing composition-the bars on one side, angular lines on the other, and that surprising human figure!', '2015-05-20 11:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351917, 1149858, 179852, '<td valign="top">Very very pleasing juxtaposition of form and color.  The mortar in the bricks is a wonderful counterpoint to the gray wall.</td>', 'Very very pleasing juxtaposition of form and color.  The mortar in the bricks is a wonderful counterpoint to the gray wall.', '2015-05-20 11:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351918, 1149880, 173844, '<td valign="top">Certainly creepy, and that tender glow only ups the ante.  The perspective is most engaging.  I really like the delicate blues.  Unusual and impressive.</td>', 'Certainly creepy, and that tender glow only ups the ante.  The perspective is most engaging.  I really like the delicate blues.  Unusual and impressive.', '2015-05-20 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351927, 1149840, 173844, '<td valign="top">A modest gem.  The box-like structure is part of the image but not in a forward, aggressive manner.  It''s almost subsumed by its delicate, fairy tale setting.  The day itself is fresh and heartfelt.  The colors are marvelous --  greens, blue, salmon and bright red.<br/>Pity about that wire, though.</td>', 'A modest gem.  The box-like structure is part of the image but not in a forward, aggressive manner.  It''s almost subsumed by its delicate, fairy tale setting.  The day itself is fresh and heartfelt.  The colors are marvelous --  greens, blue, salmon and bright red.Pity about that wire, though.', '2015-05-20 11:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351948, 1149566, 173844, '<td valign="top">Exotic and captivating.  Like a page from an old explorer''s travelogue.  The fine grained visual texture reluctantly gives up its secret.  The green tint works really well.  I also like the blurred leaves in the foreground.  In its way, charming.  <br/>Googled "Fe Fi" and found the ideas to be interesting, and something I was completely unfamiliar with, but now I''m even more perplexed.</td>', 'Exotic and captivating.  Like a page from an old explorer''s travelogue.  The fine grained visual texture reluctantly gives up its secret.  The green tint works really well.  I also like the blurred leaves in the foreground.  In its way, charming.  Googled "Fe Fi" and found the ideas to be interesting, and something I was completely unfamiliar with, but now I''m even more perplexed.', '2015-05-20 11:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351956, 1149849, 173844, '<td valign="top">The backwards-leaning perspective lends a sense of sphinx-like majesty.  Even as it succumbs to age it proudly surveys its realm.  The composition is nicely balanced.  The tint harmonizes with the mood.<br/>I looked up Burrow Mump in Google images and prefer your depiction to any one shown there.</td>', 'The backwards-leaning perspective lends a sense of sphinx-like majesty.  Even as it succumbs to age it proudly surveys its realm.  The composition is nicely balanced.  The tint harmonizes with the mood.I looked up Burrow Mump in Google images and prefer your depiction to any one shown there.', '2015-05-20 12:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351991, 1149596, 177322, '<td valign="top">Even though the focus is on the door, my eye is drawn to the other building down the road.  Perhaps it is the swoop of the sidewalk that pulls me there?<br/>If the building on the right had been cropped out, it may have added more stature to the subject building.  Plus, you are dealing with a blown out sky which tends to flatten the overall impact of the image. Nonetheless, a good effort for this challenge.<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-05-22 14:28:00.</i></td>', 'Even though the focus is on the door, my eye is drawn to the other building down the road.  Perhaps it is the swoop of the sidewalk that pulls me there?If the building on the right had been cropped out, it may have added more stature to the subject building.  Plus, you are dealing with a blown out sky which tends to flatten the overall impact of the image. Nonetheless, a good effort for this challenge.', '2015-05-20 14:26:53.000000', '2015-05-22 15:28:00.000000', 1),
(7351993, 1149646, 177322, '<td valign="top">The grain is perfect. The smokestacks appear oddly flat, but it is probably a function of the processing and is really not a large fault.  I like the leading line of the green trees to the subject.  Well framed.  Good composition.</td>', 'The grain is perfect. The smokestacks appear oddly flat, but it is probably a function of the processing and is really not a large fault.  I like the leading line of the green trees to the subject.  Well framed.  Good composition.', '2015-05-20 14:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351994, 1149852, 177322, '<td valign="top">Maybe just a tad over processed?  I, personally, would like to have seen more separation in the texture and color between the grass and barn. Still, nicely framed; good clarity.  Excellent find for this challenge.</td>', 'Maybe just a tad over processed?  I, personally, would like to have seen more separation in the texture and color between the grass and barn. Still, nicely framed; good clarity.  Excellent find for this challenge.', '2015-05-20 14:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352049, 1149780, 173844, '<td valign="top">This house has been through a lot, and now comes a storm -  or at least ominous clouds  - with its charged, coiled light.  It''s a lovely, detailed, textured study, subtly framed by sky and flora.  The terrific title brings so much feeling to the photo, feeling that''s already there but that''s now amplified in poignancy.  Very strong.</td>', 'This house has been through a lot, and now comes a storm -  or at least ominous clouds  - with its charged, coiled light.  It''s a lovely, detailed, textured study, subtly framed by sky and flora.  The terrific title brings so much feeling to the photo, feeling that''s already there but that''s now amplified in poignancy.  Very strong.', '2015-05-20 19:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352092, 1149870, 104230, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing abstract and I gave it one of my highest votes, although IMO there is not much to show that this building is abandoned since I assume a certain amount of rust is par for the course.</td>', 'A very pleasing abstract and I gave it one of my highest votes, although IMO there is not much to show that this building is abandoned since I assume a certain amount of rust is par for the course.', '2015-05-21 01:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352094, 1149566, 104230, '<td valign="top">Initially I didn''t much like the processing style, but the longer I looked the more it started to feel appropriate for the topic.</td>', 'Initially I didn''t much like the processing style, but the longer I looked the more it started to feel appropriate for the topic.', '2015-05-21 01:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352096, 1149884, 16106, '<td valign="top">This is not A BUILDING. Never the less it is my favorite photograph in the challenge, but I wonder how often it will get knocked for my first point. the light and the editing are just lovely, well seen.</td>', 'This is not A BUILDING. Never the less it is my favorite photograph in the challenge, but I wonder how often it will get knocked for my first point. the light and the editing are just lovely, well seen.', '2015-05-21 03:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352100, 1149806, 97225, '<td valign="top">What is the story? This is absolutely fascinating. Top pick. 10</td>', 'What is the story? This is absolutely fascinating. Top pick. 10', '2015-05-21 04:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352116, 1149817, 177322, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured.</td>', 'Nicely captured.', '2015-05-21 09:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352194, 1149834, 173844, '<td valign="top">Not only abandoned but forbidden, as per the rope and signs.  And so the somber tint handily furthers the point.  What I really like about this image is the composition of squares and (other) rectangles comprising the entry.  It looks like a quilt that''s anything but gay.  But it brings a bit of order to the scene.</td>', 'Not only abandoned but forbidden, as per the rope and signs.  And so the somber tint handily furthers the point.  What I really like about this image is the composition of squares and (other) rectangles comprising the entry.  It looks like a quilt that''s anything but gay.  But it brings a bit of order to the scene.', '2015-05-21 15:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352196, 1149870, 173844, '<td valign="top">A pretty patch of dilapidation.  It''s come what may, and it''s come together quite nicely.  I admire your eye.  The colors are wonderful, especially the door, which juts out in brightness.  Additionally, I''m fond of rust.</td>', 'A pretty patch of dilapidation.  It''s come what may, and it''s come together quite nicely.  I admire your eye.  The colors are wonderful, especially the door, which juts out in brightness.  Additionally, I''m fond of rust.', '2015-05-21 16:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352197, 1149901, 23098, '<td valign="top">I like the eeriness of this with the night sky and the mysterious hand.</td>', 'I like the eeriness of this with the night sky and the mysterious hand.', '2015-05-21 16:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352198, 1149894, 23098, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and detail.</td>', 'Nice colors and detail.', '2015-05-21 16:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352199, 1149817, 23098, '<td valign="top">Quite a menagerie.</td>', 'Quite a menagerie.', '2015-05-21 16:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352200, 1149870, 23098, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and colors.</td>', 'Nice lines and colors.', '2015-05-21 16:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352201, 1149684, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s like this abandoned structure is being reborn, or at least repurposed.  The balance between the walls, floor and ceiling is nicely handled.  I think the window secures the entire image, opening up to the world outside and allowing the sunlight to pour in.</td>', 'It''s like this abandoned structure is being reborn, or at least repurposed.  The balance between the walls, floor and ceiling is nicely handled.  I think the window secures the entire image, opening up to the world outside and allowing the sunlight to pour in.', '2015-05-21 16:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352205, 1149743, 173844, '<td valign="top">The title hints at a dark past, and now the image seems spookier.  The wrought iron fence is a good touch, a measure of attempted safety.  Now the peaked roof starts to resemble a witch''s hat.  The processing furthers the mood.  Well realized.</td>', 'The title hints at a dark past, and now the image seems spookier.  The wrought iron fence is a good touch, a measure of attempted safety.  Now the peaked roof starts to resemble a witch''s hat.  The processing furthers the mood.  Well realized.', '2015-05-21 16:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352206, 1149625, 23098, '<td valign="top">Abandened but maybe still being used as a shelter.  I like the processing and detail.</td>', 'Abandened but maybe still being used as a shelter.  I like the processing and detail.', '2015-05-21 16:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352207, 1149535, 173844, '<td valign="top">After all the carnage light pours in and almost flushes out the ghosts, but for those who remember.  Besides the philosophical give and take, I like the diagonal lines and the movement they engender.  Nice composition.</td>', 'After all the carnage light pours in and almost flushes out the ghosts, but for those who remember.  Besides the philosophical give and take, I like the diagonal lines and the movement they engender.  Nice composition.', '2015-05-21 16:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352209, 1149578, 23098, '<td valign="top">Great colors and tones.</td>', 'Great colors and tones.', '2015-05-21 16:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352210, 1149878, 173844, '<td valign="top">Scruffy subject presented forthrightly.  Gives off a sad feeling of being unloved.  Curious how the window is boarded up from within, suggesting inner turmoil.  Guess I''m reading a lot into this, but that goes to show that the image is provocative.</td>', 'Scruffy subject presented forthrightly.  Gives off a sad feeling of being unloved.  Curious how the window is boarded up from within, suggesting inner turmoil.  Guess I''m reading a lot into this, but that goes to show that the image is provocative.', '2015-05-21 16:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352211, 1149899, 23098, '<td valign="top">Even the weeds are old and  abandoned. Nice perspective.</td>', 'Even the weeds are old and  abandoned. Nice perspective.', '2015-05-21 16:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352212, 1149884, 23098, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and light.</td>', 'I like the perspective and light.', '2015-05-21 16:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352215, 1149736, 173844, '<td valign="top">The way the foundation is revealed gives the house a spherical appearance, furthered by the mouth revealed by the fallen plank.  Kind of like a jack-o-lantern.  The pink  piece of clothing, as it looks like, provides a lingering touch.  Has a fairy tale feel to it, which is very interesting.</td>', 'The way the foundation is revealed gives the house a spherical appearance, furthered by the mouth revealed by the fallen plank.  Kind of like a jack-o-lantern.  The pink  piece of clothing, as it looks like, provides a lingering touch.  Has a fairy tale feel to it, which is very interesting.', '2015-05-21 16:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352217, 1149889, 173844, '<td valign="top">The atmosphere, processing and focus give this building an air of lingering in the past, like a antebellum plantation.  The overgrown fence cleverly transfers the sense of abandonment to the structure.  A subtle memento.</td>', 'The atmosphere, processing and focus give this building an air of lingering in the past, like a antebellum plantation.  The overgrown fence cleverly transfers the sense of abandonment to the structure.  A subtle memento.', '2015-05-21 17:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352219, 1149817, 173844, '<td valign="top">Imaginative reuse of this bricked up brick building.</td>', 'Imaginative reuse of this bricked up brick building.', '2015-05-21 17:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352224, 1149894, 173844, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a beached whale.  How many people must have lost their jobs when this closed.  Like a depression era (1930''s) documentary photograph, it just presents the fact for contemplation.  Nicely framed by trees and sky.</td>', 'Reminds me of a beached whale.  How many people must have lost their jobs when this closed.  Like a depression era (1930''s) documentary photograph, it just presents the fact for contemplation.  Nicely framed by trees and sky.', '2015-05-21 17:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352226, 1149578, 173844, '<td valign="top">Evocative image allowing the viewer to choose hopefulness or poignancy.  Well set up by the bland colors that frame the interior.  The sunniness of the day just adds to the sense of being off balance.</td>', 'Evocative image allowing the viewer to choose hopefulness or poignancy.  Well set up by the bland colors that frame the interior.  The sunniness of the day just adds to the sense of being off balance.', '2015-05-21 17:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352229, 1149838, 173844, '<td valign="top">Edgy image of bright colors, sultry woman behind bars and lots of noise in the shadows.  Comes together in, well, an edgy way.</td>', 'Edgy image of bright colors, sultry woman behind bars and lots of noise in the shadows.  Comes together in, well, an edgy way.', '2015-05-21 17:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352231, 1149715, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s a clinical feel to this brought on by the sharp angles and edges, despite the evidence of dirt on the floor and a tattered ceiling.  What makes this image for me is the overall iridescence.  There''s a sense of expectation here, as if the building itself is going to pull off some transformative miracle.  Fine capture of this elusive atmosphere.</td>', 'There''s a clinical feel to this brought on by the sharp angles and edges, despite the evidence of dirt on the floor and a tattered ceiling.  What makes this image for me is the overall iridescence.  There''s a sense of expectation here, as if the building itself is going to pull off some transformative miracle.  Fine capture of this elusive atmosphere.', '2015-05-21 17:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352233, 1149858, 173844, '<td valign="top">Though very much of a piece, for me the left and right halves of this image seem to be grafted together.  It''s my own shortcoming, not the picture''s.  I''m not making the leap of faith, of grace, that''s needed.  But I still feel that this is a terrific photo.</td>', 'Though very much of a piece, for me the left and right halves of this image seem to be grafted together.  It''s my own shortcoming, not the picture''s.  I''m not making the leap of faith, of grace, that''s needed.  But I still feel that this is a terrific photo.', '2015-05-21 18:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352235, 1149787, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pass.  But I get your sense of urgency, of a hasty departure well in the past.  Except for the vegetation, everything here is bleached, including the sky.  There''s a sense of not only abandonment, but of a draining of the lifeblood of this structure.  I like the composition that expresses the downward slide of time.</td>', 'Pass.  But I get your sense of urgency, of a hasty departure well in the past.  Except for the vegetation, everything here is bleached, including the sky.  There''s a sense of not only abandonment, but of a draining of the lifeblood of this structure.  I like the composition that expresses the downward slide of time.', '2015-05-21 18:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352236, 1149901, 173844, '<td valign="top">Mysteriously lit gas station that has the feel of a particular Edward Hopper painting.  I would prefer it without the shadow hand, but certainly grant the horror movie effect.  The bright light to the right is a distraction, but overall I think this is a very evocative image.</td>', 'Mysteriously lit gas station that has the feel of a particular Edward Hopper painting.  I would prefer it without the shadow hand, but certainly grant the horror movie effect.  The bright light to the right is a distraction, but overall I think this is a very evocative image.', '2015-05-21 18:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352237, 1149826, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and sense of being gutted.  Real feeling of quiet, bygone gentility.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and sense of being gutted.  Real feeling of quiet, bygone gentility.', '2015-05-21 18:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352238, 1149675, 173844, '<td valign="top">I think this might fare better as a black and white because the brightness of the day and colors belies the feeling of real abandonment, unless that''s what you''re going for, in which case, please excuse me.  A good sense of immediacy.</td>', 'I think this might fare better as a black and white because the brightness of the day and colors belies the feeling of real abandonment, unless that''s what you''re going for, in which case, please excuse me.  A good sense of immediacy.', '2015-05-21 18:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352239, 1149625, 173844, '<td valign="top">Despite the abandonment, this looks like a set piece on a stage.  The presence of past inhabitants is almost tangible.  So there''s a perky freshness here that''s appealing.</td>', 'Despite the abandonment, this looks like a set piece on a stage.  The presence of past inhabitants is almost tangible.  So there''s a perky freshness here that''s appealing.', '2015-05-21 18:26:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7352241, 1149619, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a eccentric little structure!  The sense of abandonment here is more of the person who built it than the structure itself. Nice perspective and sun flare.</td>', 'What a eccentric little structure!  The sense of abandonment here is more of the person who built it than the structure itself. Nice perspective and sun flare.', '2015-05-21 18:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352243, 1149726, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fresh coat of paint and some trimming could spruce this place right up.  Time has yet to exert its ravages.  There''s a feeling of cheerfulness here that is rather inviting.</td>', 'A fresh coat of paint and some trimming could spruce this place right up.  Time has yet to exert its ravages.  There''s a feeling of cheerfulness here that is rather inviting.', '2015-05-21 18:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352244, 1149883, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very honest title.  And neglect is on the spectrum.  There''s a wary sense of impending downfall here, captured by a discerning eye.</td>', 'Very honest title.  And neglect is on the spectrum.  There''s a wary sense of impending downfall here, captured by a discerning eye.', '2015-05-21 18:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352246, 1149899, 173844, '<td valign="top">Artistic foreground adds some grace notes to this Alamo-like structure.  You''ve captured this structure on the cusp of letting go.  There''s a nice sense of time waiting in the wing.</td>', 'Artistic foreground adds some grace notes to this Alamo-like structure.  You''ve captured this structure on the cusp of letting go.  There''s a nice sense of time waiting in the wing.', '2015-05-21 18:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352247, 1149519, 173844, '<td valign="top">I would, if I may be so presumptuous, lop off the right side of this image, as it seems to add little to the main attraction.  The abandonment here is so ancient and complete that, as ruins go, this is rather jaunty, as if the remnants are engaged in a courtly dance.  As such it''s an image that''s enjoyable to look at.</td>', 'I would, if I may be so presumptuous, lop off the right side of this image, as it seems to add little to the main attraction.  The abandonment here is so ancient and complete that, as ruins go, this is rather jaunty, as if the remnants are engaged in a courtly dance.  As such it''s an image that''s enjoyable to look at.', '2015-05-21 18:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352248, 1149596, 173844, '<td valign="top">I sense here the plight of the small town.  The building is crisp and ready to engage, but the economy itself has abandoned it.  Good sense of being forlorn, and a well laid out composition. The 2 hour parking sign is a fine touch of irony.</td>', 'I sense here the plight of the small town.  The building is crisp and ready to engage, but the economy itself has abandoned it.  Good sense of being forlorn, and a well laid out composition. The 2 hour parking sign is a fine touch of irony.', '2015-05-21 18:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352249, 1149625, 16106, '<td valign="top">Gloriously found, framed and captured. But for me, some of the magic spilled away in your editing. The pastel hues and lack of a true black, take some of the brooding mystery of the subject matter and spill it away into the land of tone mapped blah. Sure you get all the details in the shadows, but you give up so much, including, I expect, the blue ribbon. Still my second favorite, but it could have been the clear winner.<br/>Coming back to praise rather than carp about what isn''t there. I truly love the way the eye is lead through the frame. The spiral from the glove, through the bedding across the chair, desk and out into the explosion of destruction and decay is just lovely.</td>', 'Gloriously found, framed and captured. But for me, some of the magic spilled away in your editing. The pastel hues and lack of a true black, take some of the brooding mystery of the subject matter and spill it away into the land of tone mapped blah. Sure you get all the details in the shadows, but you give up so much, including, I expect, the blue ribbon. Still my second favorite, but it could have been the clear winner.Coming back to praise rather than carp about what isn''t there. I truly love the way the eye is lead through the frame. The spiral from the glove, through the bedding across the chair, desk and out into the explosion of destruction and decay is just lovely.', '2015-05-21 18:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352250, 1149834, 16106, '<td valign="top">Elegant, subtle and minimal. The contrast in textures between the rope and all the hard surfaces really works here.</td>', 'Elegant, subtle and minimal. The contrast in textures between the rope and all the hard surfaces really works here.', '2015-05-21 19:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352252, 1149806, 16106, '<td valign="top">Im of two minds here. I like the highly stylized approach of heavy frame and subtle hues, yet this is such a great find for the challenge that I wonder if you didn''t give up too much in the textures and richness of tones to get that effect. I would love to see some outtakes of this set with a more documentary approach perhaps with a more burnt in brooding sky rather than the wash of empty we see here.</td>', 'Im of two minds here. I like the highly stylized approach of heavy frame and subtle hues, yet this is such a great find for the challenge that I wonder if you didn''t give up too much in the textures and richness of tones to get that effect. I would love to see some outtakes of this set with a more documentary approach perhaps with a more burnt in brooding sky rather than the wash of empty we see here.', '2015-05-21 19:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352253, 1149661, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like the brooding tone and I see why you have the big branch in the upper right to lead in the eye, but I think the structure is playing second fiddle to the foliage. More house being swallowed less trees doing the swallowing might have been stronger. those fleck of white trash in the foreground and in the tree are bothersome; pick them up, burn them down a bit or toss in more to make them a theme, all would have worked, but as they are they are distractions.</td>', 'I like the brooding tone and I see why you have the big branch in the upper right to lead in the eye, but I think the structure is playing second fiddle to the foliage. More house being swallowed less trees doing the swallowing might have been stronger. those fleck of white trash in the foreground and in the tree are bothersome; pick them up, burn them down a bit or toss in more to make them a theme, all would have worked, but as they are they are distractions.', '2015-05-21 19:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352255, 1149715, 16106, '<td valign="top">Glorious light with interesting asymmetry. I like the blues and the yellows with that hint of pink at the ceiling. It reminds me of the work of Robert Irwin.<br/> My one quibble is the skewed roof beam. It would have made a more pleasing image (for me alone perhaps) had you skewed the image to justify that beam and the side walls from keystoned,into perfect symmetry to allow the walls and the decayed roof to be the only things out of balance. It is pretty easy to do and legal in this rule set, and the sort of edit that would have stilled the image into a pure exploration of light</td>', 'Glorious light with interesting asymmetry. I like the blues and the yellows with that hint of pink at the ceiling. It reminds me of the work of Robert Irwin. My one quibble is the skewed roof beam. It would have made a more pleasing image (for me alone perhaps) had you skewed the image to justify that beam and the side walls from keystoned,into perfect symmetry to allow the walls and the decayed roof to be the only things out of balance. It is pretty easy to do and legal in this rule set, and the sort of edit that would have stilled the image into a pure exploration of light', '2015-05-21 19:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352258, 1149899, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but given the challenge I''d prefer the building to be more than a backdrop.</td>', 'Nice shot, but given the challenge I''d prefer the building to be more than a backdrop.', '2015-05-21 19:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352260, 1149628, 156466, '<td valign="top">That branch really pulls my eye away instead of leading me to the building.</td>', 'That branch really pulls my eye away instead of leading me to the building.', '2015-05-21 19:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352263, 1149880, 156466, '<td valign="top">A little to glowy but really nice otherwise</td>', 'A little to glowy but really nice otherwise', '2015-05-21 19:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352265, 1149901, 156466, '<td valign="top">If the hand is added I''m not sure I''m a fan of it.  Well taken and processed otherwise.</td>', 'If the hand is added I''m not sure I''m a fan of it.  Well taken and processed otherwise.', '2015-05-21 19:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352268, 1149707, 173844, '<td valign="top">For whatever reasons, it ran out of juice, which feels especially forlorn, as if it''s dying from within.  It''s photographed in a dignified, bright manner, to give it its due.  There''s a nice, rhythmic procession of vertical lines.</td>', 'For whatever reasons, it ran out of juice, which feels especially forlorn, as if it''s dying from within.  It''s photographed in a dignified, bright manner, to give it its due.  There''s a nice, rhythmic procession of vertical lines.', '2015-05-21 20:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352269, 1149786, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like how you can see through the far side of the roof, as if it''s moth-eaten and lacy.  Parts of the outer walls are difficult to get hold of, either from cryptic coloration or lack of crisp focus.</td>', 'I like how you can see through the far side of the roof, as if it''s moth-eaten and lacy.  Parts of the outer walls are difficult to get hold of, either from cryptic coloration or lack of crisp focus.', '2015-05-21 20:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352274, 1149858, 50864, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.</td>', 'One of my favorites.', '2015-05-21 21:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352276, 1149661, 50864, '<td valign="top">Very deserted. I like the bag in the tree. My top pick.</td>', 'Very deserted. I like the bag in the tree. My top pick.', '2015-05-21 21:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352283, 1149783, 173844, '<td valign="top">In pretty good shape but for the roof.  When that goes, decay will accelerate.  A vivid snapshot of the tipping point.</td>', 'In pretty good shape but for the roof.  When that goes, decay will accelerate.  A vivid snapshot of the tipping point.', '2015-05-21 22:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352284, 1149625, 83149, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the processing.</td>', 'Not a fan of the processing.', '2015-05-21 22:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352285, 1149730, 83149, '<td valign="top">The border just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The border just doesn''t work for me.', '2015-05-21 22:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352286, 1149601, 173844, '<td valign="top">In a strange way this could be seen as reversing decay, but the visual effect of texture ends up looking like static.  On a structure with more defined blocks of dark and light this approach could make a fascinating study.</td>', 'In a strange way this could be seen as reversing decay, but the visual effect of texture ends up looking like static.  On a structure with more defined blocks of dark and light this approach could make a fascinating study.', '2015-05-21 22:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352288, 1149601, 96915, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the processing of this.</td>', 'I don''t understand the processing of this.', '2015-05-21 22:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352289, 1149730, 173844, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell, but this house seems to be more a visual blight for the neighborhood than an abandoned building, but perhaps it''s just off and running.  The windows are quite intact.  Perhaps it''s just slumming.</td>', 'Can''t really tell, but this house seems to be more a visual blight for the neighborhood than an abandoned building, but perhaps it''s just off and running.  The windows are quite intact.  Perhaps it''s just slumming.', '2015-05-21 23:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352293, 1149662, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s certainly falling apart, however the windows are, surprisingly, unbroken.  Leads me to figure the decay is recent and rapid.  There could be a return look challenge in about three years.  I like how it seems the gas pumps have been ripped from their roots --  nothing half way about it.</td>', 'It''s certainly falling apart, however the windows are, surprisingly, unbroken.  Leads me to figure the decay is recent and rapid.  There could be a return look challenge in about three years.  I like how it seems the gas pumps have been ripped from their roots --  nothing half way about it.', '2015-05-21 23:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352295, 1149628, 173844, '<td valign="top">This small structure looks like a toll booth on the road that the new thruway has made redundant.  It''s being overtaken by vegetation, of which that in the foreground is menacingly approaching.  This adds depth of space and time.  It''s a nicely seen tiny mystery, due to become only more hidden and exotic.</td>', 'This small structure looks like a toll booth on the road that the new thruway has made redundant.  It''s being overtaken by vegetation, of which that in the foreground is menacingly approaching.  This adds depth of space and time.  It''s a nicely seen tiny mystery, due to become only more hidden and exotic.', '2015-05-21 23:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352296, 1149822, 173844, '<td valign="top">Exceptional image.  The sense of abandonment is amplified by a sense of keening emptiness.  The exterior reflections are powerful, especially the beautifully positioned human form, into which open portal upon portal to the soul.  The shabby foreground makes an ominous threshold.  Within the interior are a series of pleasing rectangles, surprisingly orderly and calming.  In total it''s emotionally and aesthetically moving.<br/>My personal favorite in the challenge, and one of my favorites on the site.</td>', 'Exceptional image.  The sense of abandonment is amplified by a sense of keening emptiness.  The exterior reflections are powerful, especially the beautifully positioned human form, into which open portal upon portal to the soul.  The shabby foreground makes an ominous threshold.  Within the interior are a series of pleasing rectangles, surprisingly orderly and calming.  In total it''s emotionally and aesthetically moving.My personal favorite in the challenge, and one of my favorites on the site.', '2015-05-21 23:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352297, 1149891, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully suggestive.  It''s a visual poem.  The muted palette, grainy and sprinkled with some bright lights, is a revelation of somber beauty.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Wonderfully suggestive.  It''s a visual poem.  The muted palette, grainy and sprinkled with some bright lights, is a revelation of somber beauty.  One of my favorites.', '2015-05-21 23:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352331, 1149596, 50695, '<td valign="top">i feel the abandon</td>', 'i feel the abandon', '2015-05-22 00:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352332, 1149871, 50695, '<td valign="top">great composition of lines</td>', 'great composition of lines', '2015-05-22 00:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352338, 1149578, 96915, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.  Bumping up the score.</td>', 'Love the colors.  Bumping up the score.', '2015-05-22 00:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7352339, 1149822, 96915, '<td valign="top">Creative and unique, I enjoy the use of the reflection.</td>', 'Creative and unique, I enjoy the use of the reflection.', '2015-05-22 00:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
