(7352606, 1149861, 38162, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> The line of structures is held together, in a way, by the parade of textures beautifully delineated by the black and white format.  The perspective draws the viewer right into the scene.  The contrast is attractive and fine-grained.  There''s a fussy harmony to all the windows and doors.  Makes a strong statement. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thank you for taking the time to provide incite with your detailed commentary.  greatly appreciated.</td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: The line of structures is held together, in a way, by the parade of textures beautifully delineated by the black and white format.  The perspective draws the viewer right into the scene.  The contrast is attractive and fine-grained.  There''s a fussy harmony to all the windows and doors.  Makes a strong statement.   thank you for taking the time to provide incite with your detailed commentary.  greatly appreciated.', '2015-05-22 23:13:56.000000', NULL, 0),
